# Time — main endpoints. Generated skeleton, synthetic data only.
# Path ids below are placeholders — replace with real ids from a list call.
@timesheet = 1
# Variables: see rest/http-client.env.json (host, session, xsrf). How to get them: docs/guides/api.md
# Full list of Time operations: /api/docs (tag "Time").

### GET /api/time/week — time.week
GET {{host}}/api/time/week
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}

### PUT /api/time/week — time.week.save
PUT {{host}}/api/time/week
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Referer: {{host}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "entries": [
        {
            "date": "2026-10-01",
            "hours": 1.5
        }
    ]
}

### POST /api/time/week/submit — time.week.submit
POST {{host}}/api/time/week/submit
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Referer: {{host}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "week": "2026-10-01",
    "employee_id": 1,
    "branch_id": 1
}

